Z||000005||Denny||08-07-2001||11:42 AM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Vendors and those wishing to sell/swap parts and/or Fiero-related stuff are welcome at the 2nd annual Fiero Dutch Classic. And the space is free!<P>Please see <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieropride.com/</A>  for information about the show.<P>We will direct you to the proper location on the show field, all you have to do is show up and set up!<P>The show ends around 1 PM, and cruise night starts at 6, so all we ask is that you are packed up and off the show field before 6.<P>See you there!<P>Denny<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
